# Git Commands After Fixes

After making and validating any code fix in this project, include terminal commands to commit and push the relevant changed files.

Use targeted `git add` commands for files changed by the fix.

Do not include generated files or Xcode UI state, especially:

```zsh
DocDesktop.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/evam.xcuserdatad/UserInterfaceState.xcuserstate
```

Prefer this shape:

```zsh
cd "/Users/evam/Desktop/XCode Dev/DocDesktop"

git status
git add <changed files>
git commit -m "<clear commit message>"
git pull --rebase origin main
git push origin main
```
